GS NVDA pre-
Nvidia Preview (BUY / PT USD250 / 20% Upside): We expect investors to focus on: 
(1) the magnitude of upside to Nvidia's $1 trillion datacenter guidance at GTC; 
(2) potential upside from agentic AI to the server CPU business; 
(3) competitive dynamics; 
(4) gross margin outlook given rising input costs. 
We expect Nvidia to deliver a ~$2bn revenue beat in 1Q, and we stand 3% above the Street for 2Q revenue;
our 1Q/2Q EPS estimates are 7% / 8% above the Street
